---
const siteUrl = 'https://alitrio.com';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>El caso: de coding manual a factory agéntica | Alitrio</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Cómo más de 800 developers de una retail enterprise LATAM pasaron a trabajar con una software factory agéntica en producción. La experiencia detrás de Alitrio." />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#102633" />
    <link rel="canonical" href={`${siteUrl}/caso`} />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="es" href={`${siteUrl}/caso`} />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href={`${siteUrl}/caso?lang=en`} />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href={`${siteUrl}/caso`} />
    <meta property="og:type" content="article" />
    <meta property="og:url" content={`${siteUrl}/caso`} />
    <meta property="og:title" content="El caso: de coding manual a factory agéntica | Alitrio" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="La transformación IA a escala enterprise que está detrás de Alitrio." />
    <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'%3E%3Crect width='32' height='32' fill='%23102633'/%3E%3Ccircle cx='16' cy='16' r='6' fill='%230b9292'/%3E%3C/svg%3E" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:opsz,wght@9..40,400;9..40,500;9..40,600;9..40,700&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip" href="#main" data-lang="es">Ir al contenido</a><a class="skip" href="#main" data-lang="en" hidden>Skip to content</a>
    <header>
      <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Alitrio home">ALITRIO<span>.</span></a>
      <nav aria-label="Primary navigation"><a href="/#services" data-lang="es">Qué hacemos</a><a href="/#method" data-lang="es">Cómo trabajamos</a><a href="/#contact" data-lang="es">Contacto</a><a href="/#services" data-lang="en" hidden>What we do</a><a href="/#method" data-lang="en" hidden>How we work</a><a href="/#contact" data-lang="en" hidden>Contact</a></nav>
      <div class="switch" aria-label="Language selector"><button type="button" data-language="es" aria-pressed="true">ES</button><button type="button" data-language="en" aria-pressed="false">EN</button></div>
    </header>
    <main id="main">
      <section class="hero">
        <div>
          <p class="overline" data-lang="es">El caso</p><p class="overline" data-lang="en" hidden>The case</p>
          <h1 data-lang="es">De coding manual a una <em>factory agéntica.</em></h1><h1 data-lang="en" hidden>From manual coding to an <em>agentic factory.</em></h1>
          <p class="summary" data-lang="es">Cómo más de 800 developers de una retail enterprise LATAM pasaron a construir software con agentes en producción. La experiencia que está detrás de Alitrio.</p><p class="summary" data-lang="en" hidden>How 800+ developers at a LATAM retail enterprise moved to building software with agents in production. The experience behind Alitrio.</p>
          <a class="action" href="/#contact" data-lang="es">Hablemos <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 2v11M4 9l4 4 4-4" /></svg></a><a class="action" href="/#contact" data-lang="en" hidden>Let’s talk <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 2v11M4 9l4 4 4-4" /></svg></a>
        </div>
        <div class="map" data-lang="es" aria-label="Impacto de la transformación"><span class="start">Coding manual</span><span class="end">Factory agéntica</span><i></i><b class="one">800+ developers</b><b class="two">Producción</b><b class="three">Enterprise LATAM</b><p>La IA dentro<br />del proceso.</p></div>
        <div class="map" data-lang="en" hidden aria-label="Transformation impact"><span class="start">Manual coding</span><span class="end">Agentic factory</span><i></i><b class="one">800+ developers</b><b class="two">Production</b><b class="three">LATAM enterprise</b><p>AI inside<br />the process.</p></div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="heading">
          <h2 data-lang="es">El contexto</h2><h2 data-lang="en" hidden>The context</h2>
          <p data-lang="es">En Cencosud, una de las retail enterprises más grandes de Latinoamérica, el desarrollo de software se hacía como en todos lados: personas escribiendo código a mano, línea por línea, con IA como asistente ocasional.</p><p data-lang="en" hidden>At Cencosud, one of the largest retail enterprises in Latin America, software was built the way it is built everywhere: people writing code by hand, line by line, with AI as an occasional assistant.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="lead" data-lang="es">La transformación fue llevar a más de 800 developers a un ciclo de desarrollo agéntico: agents de Anthropic y Claude Code integrados en el SDLC completo, con orquestación multi-agente, Model Context Protocol, RAG y guardrails en producción.</p><p class="lead" data-lang="en" hidden>The transformation was moving 800+ developers to an agentic development cycle: Anthropic agents and Claude Code integrated across the full SDLC, with multi-agent orchestration, Model Context Protocol, RAG and guardrails in production.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="section learnings-section">
        <div class="heading">
          <h2 data-lang="es">Lo que aprendimos</h2><h2 data-lang="en" hidden>What we learned</h2>
          <p data-lang="es">El impacto de la IA no es lineal. Si queda en la toolchain del dev o en un chatbot, la empresa no la siente en el P&L. Funciona en dos niveles.</p><p data-lang="en" hidden>AI impact is not linear. If it stays in the dev toolchain or in a chatbot, the business does not feel it in the P&L. It works on two levels.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cards">
          <article>
            <span class="card-num">01</span>
            <h3 data-lang="es">IA dentro del proceso</h3><h3 data-lang="en" hidden>AI inside the process</h3>
            <p data-lang="es">La adopción queda instalada en la compañía y no depende de perfiles puntuales. Los procesos mismos incorporan la inteligencia: resiliencia, no héroes.</p><p data-lang="en" hidden>Adoption stays in the company and does not depend on specific individuals. Processes themselves carry the intelligence: resilience, not heroes.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span class="card-num">02</span>
            <h3 data-lang="es">IA dentro del producto</h3><h3 data-lang="en" hidden>AI inside the product</h3>
            <p data-lang="es">La IA decide sobre la transacción, no sobre el chat. Un sistema que sugiere productos en el carrito toca la venta directamente: el impacto se mide en facturación.</p><p data-lang="en" hidden>AI decides on the transaction, not on the chat. A system that suggests products in the cart touches revenue directly: impact is measured in sales.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span class="card-num">03</span>
            <h3 data-lang="es">Un área a la vez</h3><h3 data-lang="en" hidden>One area at a time</h3>
            <p data-lang="es">La transformación no frenó la operación. Se construyó área por área, con resultados medibles en cada paso, sin promesas de roadmap.</p><p data-lang="en" hidden>The transformation did not stop the operation. It was built area by area, with measurable results at every step, not roadmap promises.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section founder">
        <div class="heading">
          <h2 data-lang="es">Quién está detrás</h2><h2 data-lang="en" hidden>Who is behind it</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="founder-body" data-lang="es">
          <p><strong>Germán Aliprandi</strong> diseñó y lideró esa transformación de punta a punta: la arquitectura, la adopción y la operación en producción de la factory agéntica.</p>
          <p>Hoy es Expert AI Technical Architect en NTT DATA, donde construye la estrategia de IA transversal del grupo como parte de su Center of Excellence. También es autor de herramientas open source usadas por la comunidad de agentes.</p>
          <p>Alitrio existe para llevar ese criterio a empresas que no tienen un Center of Excellence propio: misma exigencia, a tu escala.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="founder-body" data-lang="en" hidden>
          <p><strong>Germán Aliprandi</strong> designed and led that transformation end to end: the architecture, the adoption, and the production operation of the agentic factory.</p>
          <p>He is now Expert AI Technical Architect at NTT DATA, where he builds the group-wide AI strategy inside its Center of Excellence. He is also the author of open source tools used by the agent community.</p>
          <p>Alitrio exists to bring that standard to companies without their own Center of Excellence: same rigor, at your scale.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="contact-section">
        <div class="contact-copy">
          <p class="overline" data-lang="es">Empecemos</p><p class="overline" data-lang="en" hidden>Let’s start</p>
          <h2 data-lang="es">¿Llevamos esto a tu empresa?</h2><h2 data-lang="en" hidden>Shall we bring this to your company?</h2>
          <p data-lang="es">Contanos en qué momento está tu organización. Empecemos por ahí.</p><p data-lang="en" hidden>Tell us where your organization is today. We will start there.</p>
          <a class="action light" href="/#contact" data-lang="es">Hablemos <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 2v11M4 9l4 4 4-4" /></svg></a><a class="action light" href="/#contact" data-lang="en" hidden>Let’s talk <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 2v11M4 9l4 4 4-4" /></svg></a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <footer><a class="brand" href="/">ALITRIO<span>.</span></a><p data-lang="es">Transformación organizacional con IA.</p><p data-lang="en" hidden>Organizational transformation with AI.</p></footer>
    <script>
      const nodes = document.querySelectorAll('[data-lang]'), buttons = document.querySelectorAll('[data-language]');
      function setLanguage(lang) { document.documentElement.lang = lang; nodes.forEach((node) => node.hidden = node.dataset.lang !== lang); buttons.forEach((button) => button.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(button.dataset.language === lang))); const url = new URL(location.href); lang === 'en' ? url.searchParams.set('lang', 'en') : url.searchParams.delete('lang'); history.replaceState({}, '', url); }
      setLanguage(new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('lang') === 'en' ? 'en' : 'es'); buttons.forEach((button) => button.addEventListener('click', () => setLanguage(button.dataset.language)));
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
<style>
  :global(*){box-sizing:border-box}:global([hidden]){display:none!important}:global(html){scroll-behavior:smooth}:global(body){margin:0;background:#f5f3ed;color:#102633;font-family:Manrope,system-ui,sans-serif}:global(::selection){background:#aee8d7;color:#102633}:global(html){scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:#b8c2bd #f5f3ed}::-webkit-scrollbar{width:10px;height:10px}::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:#f5f3ed}::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:#b8c2bd;border:2px solid #f5f3ed}::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover{background:#8ba19e}h1,h2,h3,p{margin-top:0}h1,h2,h3,.brand{font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif}.skip{position:fixed;z-index:4;transform:translateY(-200%);top:1rem;left:1rem;background:#102633;color:#fff;padding:.8rem;text-decoration:none}.skip:focus{transform:translateY(0)}header,footer{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto;align-items:center;gap:1.5rem;max-width:1440px;margin:auto;padding:1.4rem clamp(1.25rem,4vw,4.5rem)}.brand{color:#102633;font-size:1.35rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.04em;text-decoration:none}.brand span{color:#0a7172}nav{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:clamp(.8rem,2vw,2rem)}nav a{color:#46606a;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;transition:color .2s ease}nav a:hover{color:#102633}.switch{display:flex;padding:.2rem;border:1px solid #b8c2bd;border-radius:99px}.switch button{border:0;border-radius:99px;background:transparent;color:#46606a;font-weight:800;font-size:.7rem;padding:.45rem .6rem}.switch [aria-pressed=true]{background:#102633;color:#fff}.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:clamp(2.5rem,7vw,8rem);max-width:1440px;min-height:min(680px,calc(100vh - 5rem));margin:auto;padding:clamp(3rem,8vw,7rem) clamp(1.25rem,4vw,4.5rem);align-items:center}.overline{color:#0a7172;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:1.5rem}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.6rem,5.5vw,4.8rem);letter-spacing:-.035em;line-height:1.02;margin-bottom:1.5rem}.hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:#0a7172}.summary{font-size:clamp(1.05rem,1.6vw,1.3rem);line-height:1.55;color:#46606a;max-width:34rem;margin-bottom:2.5rem}.action{display:inline-flex;gap:.8rem;align-items:center;border:0;background:#102633;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;font:700 .9rem/1 Manrope,sans-serif;padding:1rem 1.25rem;text-decoration:none;transition:.2s ease}.action:hover{background:#147e83;transform:translateY(-2px)}.action svg{width:1rem;height:1rem;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-width:1.75}.map{position:relative;display:grid;align-content:center;gap:1.2rem;min-height:340px;padding:2.5rem;border:1px solid #b8c2bd;background:#fff}.map .start,.map .end{font-size:.72rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8ba19e}.map .end{color:#0a7172}.map i{display:block;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#b8c2bd,#0a7172)}.map b{display:block;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(1.4rem,2.4vw,2rem);letter-spacing:-.025em;line-height:1.05}.map p{position:absolute;bottom:2rem;right:2rem;color:#46606a;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5;text-align:right}.section{max-width:1440px;margin:auto;padding:clamp(4rem,8vw,7rem) clamp(1.25rem,4vw,4.5rem);border-top:1px solid #b8c2bd}.heading{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2.5rem;margin-bottom:3rem}.heading h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,3.5vw,3rem);letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1.05}.heading p{color:#46606a;line-height:1.7;align-self:end}.lead{font-size:clamp(1.15rem,1.9vw,1.5rem);line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:-.01em;max-width:52ch}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:2rem}.cards article{border-top:1px solid #8ba19e;padding-top:1.5rem}.card-num{display:block;color:#0a7172;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;margin-bottom:1.5rem}.cards h3{font-size:clamp(1.2rem,1.9vw,1.55rem);letter-spacing:-.025em;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:.6rem}.cards p{color:#46606a;line-height:1.65;font-size:.96rem}.founder .founder-body{max-width:62ch;display:grid;gap:1.2rem}.founder-body p{color:#46606a;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.7}.founder-body strong{color:#102633}.contact-section{max-width:1440px;margin:auto;padding:clamp(4rem,8vw,7rem) clamp(1.25rem,4vw,4.5rem);background:#102633;color:#f5f3ed}.contact-section .overline{color:#aee8d7}.contact-section h2{color:#f5f3ed;font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4vw,3.5rem);letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1.05;margin-bottom:1rem}.contact-section p{color:#aee8d7;line-height:1.7;max-width:48ch}.contact-section .action{background:#f5f3ed;color:#102633;margin-top:1.5rem}.contact-section .action:hover{background:#aee8d7}footer{border-top:1px solid #b8c2bd;color:#46606a;font-size:.78rem}footer p{margin:0}@media(max-width:860px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}.map{min-height:260px}.heading{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1.5rem}.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media(max-width:520px){nav{display:none}.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
